    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Civilization!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Houses for your froglings so that they can grow, Utilize them to help build other structures like tower defenses and simple resource gathering buildings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431610/extras/0a687eef8cf1a1b94abdf3e5a81ecdfd.poster.avif?t=1745860256\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431610/extras/0a687eef8cf1a1b94abdf3e5a81ecdfd.webm?t=1745860256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend with defenses!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care though, as in the night a raid of robots will want to come and destroy everything you've built! Use the different tower defenses you unlock along the way and your hero to protect your new home and keep it safe from the evil robots.<br><br>Grow and prosper your frogling community!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Civilization!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Houses for your froglings so that they can grow, Utilize them to help build other structures like tower defenses and simple resource gathering buildings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431610/extras/0a687eef8cf1a1b94abdf3e5a81ecdfd.poster.avif?t=1745860256\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431610/extras/0a687eef8cf1a1b94abdf3e5a81ecdfd.webm?t=1745860256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend with defenses!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care though, as in the night a raid of robots will want to come and destroy everything you've built! Use the different tower defenses you unlock along the way and your hero to protect your new home and keep it safe from the evil robots.<br><br>Grow and prosper your frogling community!</p>",
